From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:43:13 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] AMLCapture: change the inputs of a running stream in place

On a node with one engine, every consumer that started or stopped
restarted the shared stream. The consumer already reading lost about
one image, and vdin1 delivered short frames at the restart.
